-- The connectors the team uses in Claude, checked live against each vendor's server (Nov 11 2026): in the Directory
-- as featured even when the open MCP registry doesn't list them (Asana, HubSpot, Slack, Klaviyo, Xero and others). Source
-- 'kaizen-directory', so the registry sync never marks them unavailable. Safe to run again.
on conflict (name) do update set title = excluded.title, description = excluded.description, url = excluded.url, transport = excluded.transport,
  icon_url = excluded.icon_url, website_url = excluded.website_url, status = 'active', available = true, featured = true, vendor = excluded.vendor, last_seen_at = now();
